<title>THAILAND: Siam Sanwa 1996 net profit surges.</title>
<headline>Siam Sanwa 1996 net profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		3.86    vs    1.77</p>
<p>    Net		     187.77    vs   53.10</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Siam Sanwa Industrial Credit Plc, a finance firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
